[4. Generate naming recommendation]
       |
       v
[5. Generate tags and description]
       |
       v
[6. Recommend UoM based on category]
```

---

## ANTI-PATTERNS

### Wrong: Generic Names

```
WRONG: "Plastic Container"
RIGHT: "Floral Print PET Storage Jar 500ml"

WRONG: "Brass Hook"
RIGHT: "Brass Art Deco Wall Hook"
```

### Wrong: Assumed Positioning

```
WRONG: "This is a premium product" (no evidence)
RIGHT: "Premium positioning supported by: textured finish (20-30% premium in market),
       decorative design, quality materials. Similar textured items at Rs 40-50 vs
       plain at Rs 30-35."
```

### Wrong: Missing Context

```
WRONG:
Tags: ["container", "storage", "plastic"]

RIGHT:
Tags: ["pet-storage-jar", "kitchen-organization", "food-container",
       "bpa-free", "airtight", "pantry-storage", "meal-prep",
       "floral-print", "premium-container", "gift-set"]
```

